OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA blustery day ahead with
OL,6,Fstrongest gusts around coasts. Cloudy
OL,7,Finitially with an odd spot of rain
OL,8,Fpossible, although brighter spells
OL,9,Fpossible later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA wet
OL,12,Fand windy start to Wednesday, but this
OL,13,Fclearing to sunshine and showers.
OL,14,FTurning more settled from Thursday
OL,15,Fwith more dry and bright weather.
OL,16,FWinds also easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
